btmenu is the dmenu bluetooth controller.

Status bar block sb-bluetooth, signal 2, every 10 seconds:
	1 left click   - main menu
	2 middle click - connected devices
	3 right click  - notify-send help
	button 6 is unused; Shift+right opens dwmblocks config.h

Bar:
	(empty)  no adapter
	⛔   powered off
	🔵   adapter on, nothing connected
	🎧📱 2  connected devices by type, deduped, at most four icons, then +N, then the count
	🔵N  connected, but no known type
	each Icon lookup is `timeout 5 bluetoothctl info`

Menu:
	打开蓝牙 / 关闭蓝牙
	扫描并配对 is the 8 second scan
	动态扫描（fzf） runs `st -e btmenu --dynamic`
	已配对设备: 连接, 断开, 信任, 移除
	Cancel exits 0. No adapter exits non-zero. No PIN prompt.

--dynamic:
	scan at most 30 seconds and reload fzf once a second
	socket lives in a 0700 directory under XDG_RUNTIME_DIR, then is chmod 0600
	reload uses --listen on that Unix socket, never TCP and never --listen-unsafe
	a selection pairs with a live agent, then trusts and connects
	success requires Paired and Connected both yes
	Esc, timeout, missing fzf or missing curl exits 0 and stops the scan
	--list prints name and mac for that reload; it is not a menu
